<p>After searching around online, most solutions use predicates to check whether something is included, but very few actually process the string.</p>

<p>I found 3 ways to process the string:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Approach 1: filter with a predicate</li>
  <li>Approach 2: filter with a regular expression, increasing the length of the string being matched</li>
  <li>Approach 3: filter the string with a streamlined regular expression</li>
</ul>

